Roon artwork
------------
src/kalinka_plugin_roon/icons/roon.svg contains the plain Roon wordmark from
the header of https://roon.app/en/press (retrieved 2026-10-31). Its paths,
stroke and viewBox are unchanged; website attributes were removed and an
SVG namespace and title were added.

The Roon artwork and trademark belong to Roon Labs and are not covered by
this plugin's GPL license. The wordmark identifies the playback source.
This is an independent integration, not a Roon Labs product or a claim of
Roon Ready, Roon Tested or other Roon certification.
